IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg2-support`
IMPORT `dg2-interested-definitions`

-- Tests of dg2-interested-definitions.l4 (8 Del. C. section 144(e)). Expected values are written by hand from src:419 to src:432 of
-- de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt, beside each assertion, before the run.

§ `Section 144(e)(2): controlling stockholder`

-- control: (voting power owned or controlled with affiliates and associates, total voting power, majority of the directors-electing
-- votes, right to cause election of nominees, at least 1/3 of the directors-electing votes, power to exercise managerial authority)
GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      f IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 144(e)(2) Facts about a person's control`
`a control` a b c d e f MEANS `s 144(e)(2) Facts about a person's control` WITH
    `the voting power in the election of directors that the person owns or controls, together with its affiliates and associates` IS a
    `the voting power in the election of directors of all the outstanding stock entitled to vote generally in the election of directors` IS b
    `the person owns or controls a majority in voting power in the election of directors who have a majority in voting power of the votes of all directors` IS c
    `the person has the right, by contract or otherwise, to cause the election of nominees selected at its discretion who constitute a majority of the board of directors or directors entitled to cast a majority in voting power of the votes of all directors` IS d
    `the person owns or controls at least 1/3 in voting power in the election of directors who have a majority in voting power of the votes of all directors` IS e
    `the person has the power to exercise managerial authority over the business and affairs of the corporation` IS f

-- limb a: a majority in voting power: 51 of 100 is a majority, 50 of 100 is not.
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(2) the person is a controlling stockholder` (`a control` 51 100 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(2) the person is a controlling stockholder` (`a control` 50 100 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(2) the person is a controlling stockholder` (`a control` 0 100 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- limb b: the right to cause the election of nominees who constitute a majority.
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(2) the person is a controlling stockholder` (`a control` 0 100 FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- limb c: at least 1/3 AND power to exercise managerial authority (cumulative). 34 of 100 and 30 of 90 reach 1/3; 33 of 100 does not.
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(2) the person is a controlling stockholder` (`a control` 34 100 FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(2) the person is a controlling stockholder` (`a control` 30 90 FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(2) the person is a controlling stockholder` (`a control` 33 100 FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(2) the person is a controlling stockholder` (`a control` 40 100 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(2) the person is a controlling stockholder` (`a control` 0 100 FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(2) the person is a controlling stockholder` (`a control` 0 100 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Voting powers that cannot be a vote: not covered, unless another limb is made out.
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(2) the person is a controlling stockholder` (`a control` 0 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(2) the person is a controlling stockholder` (`a control` 0 0 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Section 144(e)(1): control group`

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 144(e)(1) Facts about a group of persons`
`a group` a b c d MEANS `s 144(e)(1) Facts about a group of persons` WITH
    `the number of persons in the group` IS a
    `none of the persons is a controlling stockholder` IS b
    `the persons are bound together by an agreement, arrangement, or understanding between or among them` IS c
    `by virtue of that agreement, arrangement, or understanding the persons constitute a controlling stockholder` IS d

#ASSERT `s 144(e)(1) the persons are a control group` (`a group` 2 TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(1) the persons are a control group` (`a group` 5 TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(1) the persons are a control group` (`a group` 1 TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(1) the persons are a control group` (`a group` 2 FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(1) the persons are a control group` (`a group` 2 TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(1) the persons are a control group` (`a group` 2 TRUE TRUE FALSE)

§ `Section 144(e)(3): controlling stockholder transaction`

#ASSERT `s 144(e)(3) the act or transaction is a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(3) the act or transaction is a controlling stockholder transaction` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(3) the act or transaction is a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(3) the act or transaction is a controlling stockholder transaction` FALSE FALSE

§ `Section 144(e)(7) and (8): material interest and material relationship`

-- (kind, a benefit exists, it devolves on the corporation or the stockholders generally, it would impair a director's objectivity,
-- it would be material to the stockholder or other person)
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(7) the person has a material interest` `a director, for the purposes of s 144(e)(7) and (8)` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(7) the person has a material interest` `a director, for the purposes of s 144(e)(7) and (8)` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(7) the person has a material interest` `a stockholder, for the purposes of s 144(e)(7) and (8)` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(7) the person has a material interest` `a stockholder, for the purposes of s 144(e)(7) and (8)` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(7) the person has a material interest` `a person other than a director or stockholder, for the purposes of s 144(e)(7) and (8)` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
-- A benefit that devolves on the corporation or the stockholders generally is not a material interest; nor is no benefit.
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(7) the person has a material interest` `a director, for the purposes of s 144(e)(7) and (8)` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(7) the person has a material interest` `a stockholder, for the purposes of s 144(e)(7) and (8)` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE

-- (kind, would impair a director's objectivity, would be material to the stockholder)
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(8) the person has a material relationship` `a director, for the purposes of s 144(e)(7) and (8)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(8) the person has a material relationship` `a director, for the purposes of s 144(e)(7) and (8)` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(8) the person has a material relationship` `a stockholder, for the purposes of s 144(e)(7) and (8)` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(8) the person has a material relationship` `a stockholder, for the purposes of s 144(e)(7) and (8)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The definition speaks of directors and stockholders only.
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(8) the person has a material relationship` `a person other than a director or stockholder, for the purposes of s 144(e)(7) and (8)` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 144(e)(4) and (5): disinterested director and stockholder`

#ASSERT `s 144(e)(4) the director is a disinterested director` FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(4) the director is a disinterested director` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(4) the director is a disinterested director` FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(4) the director is a disinterested director` FALSE FALSE TRUE

-- (the stockholder has a material interest, the relationship limb applies, the stockholder has the material relationship)
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(5) the stockholder is a disinterested stockholder` FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(5) the stockholder is a disinterested stockholder` FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(5) the stockholder is a disinterested stockholder` FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(5) the stockholder is a disinterested stockholder` FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(5) the stockholder is a disinterested stockholder` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(5) the stockholder is a disinterested stockholder` TRUE TRUE FALSE

§ `Section 144(e)(6): going private transaction`

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 144(e)(6) Facts about the transaction`
`a transaction` a b c d MEANS `s 144(e)(6) Facts about the transaction` WITH
    `the corporation has a class of equity securities subject to section 12(g) or 15(d) of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 or listed on a national securities exchange` IS a
    `the transaction is a Rule 13e-3 transaction as defined in 17 CFR 240.13e-3(a)(3) or any successor provision` IS b
    `the transaction is a controlling stockholder transaction` IS c
    `all or substantially all of the shares held by the disinterested stockholders, but not those of the controlling stockholder or control group, are cancelled, converted, purchased, or otherwise acquired or cease to be outstanding pursuant to the transaction` IS d

-- a. a corporation with registered or listed equity: the Rule 13e-3 transaction, whatever else is true.
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(6) the transaction is a going private transaction` (`a transaction` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(6) the transaction is a going private transaction` (`a transaction` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- b. any other corporation: a controlling stockholder transaction that takes out all or substantially all disinterested shares.
#ASSERT `s 144(e)(6) the transaction is a going private transaction` (`a transaction` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(6) the transaction is a going private transaction` (`a transaction` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(6) the transaction is a going private transaction` (`a transaction` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(e)(6) the transaction is a going private transaction` (`a transaction` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
